  "param.rig_humanoid.hard_surface": "Rigid armour",
  "param.rig_humanoid.hard_surface.help": "auto: for armored/heavy builds and metallic paint, each plate (grey metal in the colour map) goes entirely to its bone (helmet: Head, pauldron: shoulder, cuirass: Spine2, bracers: forearm, greaves: shin); smooth weights for cloth, leather and joints.",
