  "param.retarget.clips": "Clips",
  "param.retarget.clips.help": "List of {source, name, trim: [first, last], loop, in_place, locomotion, fps, speed, mirror, facing, facing_bone, hips_drop, hand_floor, ground}; source = library:<id>, category:<category>[:<tag>] or a clip id (an FBX path only with CLI --direct). in_place: true removes the straight start→end travel (sway stays), \"strict\" removes all XY hips travel, false keeps it; without the key root_motion decides. locomotion: treat the clip as locomotion (walk/run by default). facing, facing_bone, hips_drop, hand_floor, ground on a clip override the common ones.",
  "param.retarget.library": "Library",
  "param.retarget.library.help": "Clip library folder; filled by the server.",
  "param.retarget.root_motion": "Root motion",
  "param.retarget.root_motion.help": "lock: only walk/run play in place (the game moves the character at ground_speed_mps), other clips keep their hips travel so the feet do not slide; keep: everything as in the clip; extract: horizontal travel onto a non-deforming root bone (root motion in Godot).",
